# PC card team-table (docs/plan-team-top5.md section 10.3, TMODE-16..18): arm mk (the locked table) on the kept teams, fresh seeds, against master (the aa build). Template: ttprep writes work/team-table-gate.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
4400
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-table-gate.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@mk.jar
--robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@mk
--member
hadur2.Hadur
--out
work/team-table-@V@-gate
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-table-gate.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur2.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur2.HadurTeam @V@aa
